The catalogue summarises and cites public web pages. Every entry lists the
pages it was checked against in its "sources" field (and, under "evidence",
which of them were read). The pages and their text belong to their authors;
the catalogue links to them and paraphrases facts and technique names, it does
not republish their articles or images. Colour values are estimates read from
those pages and are given as a starting point, not as a product specification.
